<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Trilhas de Treinamento - Bayer Agro</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 min-h-screen flex flex-col">

  <!-- Header -->
  <header class="bg-white shadow-md">
    <div class="container mx-auto flex items-center justify-between py-4 px-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <img src="https://www.bayer.com/sites/default/files/styles/16_9_1280x720/public/2021-01/bayer-logo.png" alt="Bayer Logo" class="h-10 w-10">
        <a href="/">
          <span class="text-xl font-bold text-[#0057A6]">FieldAcademy</span>     
        </a>
      </div>
      <nav class="space-x-6">
        <a href="#" class="text-[#0057A6] font-medium hover:text-[#78BE20] transition">Início</a>
        <a href="#" class="text-gray-700 font-medium hover:text-[#78BE20] transition">Trilhas</a>
        <a href="#" class="text-gray-700 font-medium hover:text-[#78BE20] transition">Meu Progresso</a>
        <a href="#" class="text-gray-700 font-medium hover:text-[#78BE20] transition">Sair</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Título e filtro -->
  <main class="container mx-auto px-6 py-10 flex-1">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#0057A6] mb-4 md:mb-0">Trilhas de Treinamento</h2>
      <div>
        <input type="text" placeholder="Buscar trilha..." class="px-4 py-2 border rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#78BE20] w-64">
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Trilha 1 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md p-6 flex flex-col hover:shadow-lg transition">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#0057A6] mb-2">Trilha: Sistema Básico</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">Aprenda o essencial para começar a usar o sistema Bayer Agro.</p>
        <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
          <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 mr-2">Progresso:</span>
          <div class="w-32 bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-3">
            <div class="bg-[#78BE20] h-3 rounded-full" style="width: 60%"></div>
          </div>
          <span class="ml-2 text-sm text-[#78BE20] font-bold">60%</span>
        </div>
        <a href="/content" class="mt-auto text-[#78BE20] font-medium hover:underline">Continuar trilha</a>
      </div>
      <!-- Trilha 2 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md p-6 flex flex-col hover:shadow-lg transition">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#0057A6] mb-2">Trilha: Gestão Avançada</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">Aprofunde seus conhecimentos em gestão de dados e processos.</p>
        <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
          <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 mr-2">Progresso:</span>
          <div class="w-32 bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-3">
            <div class="bg-[#0057A6] h-3 rounded-full" style="width: 30%"></div>
          </div>
          <span class="ml-2 text-sm text-[#0057A6] font-bold">30%</span>
        </div>
        <a href="#" class="mt-auto text-[#78BE20] font-medium hover:underline">Continuar trilha</a>
      </div>
      <!-- Trilha 3 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md p-6 flex flex-col hover:shadow-lg transition">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#0057A6] mb-2">Trilha: Boas Práticas</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">Descubra como garantir qualidade e segurança no uso do sistema.</p>
        <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
          <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 mr-2">Progresso:</span>
          <div class="w-32 bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-3">
            <div class="bg-[#78BE20] h-3 rounded-full" style="width: 100%"></div>
          </div>
          <span class="ml-2 text-sm text-[#78BE20] font-bold">100%</span>
        </div>
        <a href="#" class="mt-auto text-[#78BE20] font-medium hover:underline">Ver certificado</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="bg-white border-t py-4">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between">
      <span class="text-gray-500 text-sm">&copy; 2024 Bayer AG. Todos os direitos reservados.</span>
      <div class="flex space-x-4 mt-2 md:mt-0">
        <a href="#" class="text-[#0057A6] hover:text-[#78BE20] text-sm">Política de Privacidade</a>
        <a href="#" class="text-[#0057A6] hover:text-[#78BE20] text-sm">Termos de Uso</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>